  "solution": {
    "text": "For FCC,\n$r=\\frac{\\sqrt{2} a}{4}=\\frac{a}{2 \\sqrt{2}}=0.3535 a$\ngiven $a=361 \\mathrm{~pm}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\nr & =0.3535 \\times 361 \\\\\n& =128 \\mathrm{~pm}\n\\end{aligned}$",
